ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Cubism
Board: /styles/cubism
Companions: cubism-starter.html, cubism-study.ai, cubism-study.psd

Artboards
1. Analytic study, 2400 × 2400 px. One invented object, two views, shallow space, ochre and gray only.
2. Synthetic study, same size. The same object, plus one pasted pattern rectangle. Label the pasted piece "paper" in a plain sans.

Palette
Ground #b7aa9a. Planes #e6dcc8, #8d8478, #d7c4a2. Line #5c534c. Pattern #1c1a17 and #d8c7a4.

Rules
- No deep space and no single viewpoint.
- The pattern is a real graphic laid on, not a drawing of wood or newsprint.
- Do not use a face, a guitar, a violin, or a masthead.
- Do not reproduce any existing painting or collage.
